        "title": "WhatsApp announces four new features to make group chats easier to manage",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/30/whatsapp-announces-four-new-features-to-make-group-chats-easier-to-manage/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/10/whatsapp-03.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In a blog post this week, WhatsApp confirmed that it is rolling out four new features designed to make it easier to manage group chats and keep track of what’s going on in each one. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"whatsapp\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1076736\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/30/whatsapp-announces-four-new-features-to-make-group-chats-easier-to-manage/#more-1076736\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
