        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/john-ternus-iphone-event-hub.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has launched a wave of major new products since John Ternus took over as CEO, and a new interview with Ternus reveals how this aligns very much with his primary focus.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"john-ternus\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1076611\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/30/john-ternus-defines-his-focus-as-apple-ceo-with-one-word/#more-1076611\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
