        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/this-week-in-ai-agents-rewrite-the-rules/",
        "content_text": "AI agents dominated the news this week, from security exploits that unfolded in hours to new tools that let agents shop, manage transactions, and conduct scientific research. On the latest episode of This Week in AI, host Vicki Reyzelman of Akamai examined how these developments are testing existing security practices and creating new opportunities for [&#8230;]",
